<div class="tib"><div class="lab">TIBETAN (WYLIE)</div>
<span class="u" data-d="1" data-l="s267S">de ltar <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w1">&#x27;byung ba</span> de yang <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w2">brlan</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s267p1">zhing</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w3">gsher ba</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w4">phor pa</span> <span class="u unrendered" data-d="5" data-l="s267w5">gang po</span> de <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w6">blta</span> bya <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w7">thun mong ba</span> yin pa&#x27;i <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s267w8">dbang du byas pa</span> yin <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s267p2">gyi</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w9">yi dvags</span> <span class="u case" data-d="6" data-l="s267p3">kyis</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w10">lag</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s267p4">tu</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w11">blangs</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s267p5">nas</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w12">longs spyod</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s267p6">par</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w13">brtsams pa</span> <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s267q1">de&#x27;i tshe na</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w14">khyad chos</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w15">gsum</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w16">ldan</span> du <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w17">skye ba</span> <span class="u" data-d="6" data-l="s267p7">ma</span> yin te, <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s267q2">de&#x27;i tshe na</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w18">yi dvags</span> kyi <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w19">thun mong ma yin pa&#x27;i</span> <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w20">longs spyod</span> bya <span class="u" data-d="3" data-l="s267q3">yin pas</span>, <span class="u" data-d="5" data-l="s267w21">rigs &#x27;dra phyi ma</span> <span class="u" data-