<div class="note"><b>AI NOTE</b> &mdash; PROVISIONAL machine alignment by Codex c05_253_255_reconcile, a reused non-author of these original proposals. Tibetan original: primary Codex with prior preparation; English original: reused peer c05_262_264_english. This is machine reconciliation, not human editorial acceptance. Blta/look retains the verb root; bya's nominal force is distributed between object and the English viewing reprise. Gang po has no distinct fullness exponent and is null; kyis has no separate agentive word in the active subject. Dbang du byas pa/with reference to is a complete d3 viewpoint phrase. Gyi/though, lag/hand, tu/in, blangs/picks up, nas/and and par/to preserve the actual contrast, location and complement links without supplied the glass or his. First de'i tshe na owns When, second at this point; first skye ba owns exists, second starts being. Gsum selects the later three of different parts. Ma owns no; longer belongs to the changed temporal condition. Longs spyod/experiencing retains the verb root, while bya is distributed in the something-that frame. Full yin pas/Since retains the causal relation. The attested compound rigs 'dra phyi ma owns continuation, including its succession content; no separate later is invented. Both terminal rnag/khrag members stay inside pus and blood. Full parallel extents do not establish independent publication lineage; no source or glossary edit is made.</div>
